<title>HONG KONG: Bank of East Asia to set HK$2.5 bln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Bank of East Asia to set HK$2.5 bln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by bookrunner Societe Generale Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER BANK OF EAST ASIA</p>
<p> AMOUNT   HK$2.5 BLN   COUPON    3MH+30 BP   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCH    --</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   28.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING   **	     SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	ARRANGERS	  HK$300 MLN   22.5 BP  ALL-IN 37.5BP</p>
<p> BOOKRUNNERS AND ARRANGERS     SOCIETE GENERALE ASIA AND UBS</p>
<p> NOTES    *ISSUED OFF THE BORROWER'S HK$18 BLN CD PROGRAM</p>
<p>	   **THE CD PROGRAM IS RATED A3 BY MOODY'S AND AN ISSUE</p>
<p>	     SPECIFIC RATING WILL BE SOUGHT</p>
<p>	  ***APPLICATION WILL BE MADE TO THE HK MONETARY AUTHORITY</p>
<p>	     TO ACCEPT THE ISSUE AS ELIBILE FOR USE AT THE HKMA'S</p>
<p>	     LIQUDITY ADJUSTMENT FACILITY (LAF) OR DISCOUNT</p>
<p>	     WINDOW.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
